  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An antenna is placed in a dielectric medium of dielectric constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math>.&nbsp;If the maximum size of that antenna is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>, it can radiate a signal of minimum frequency of _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>GHz</mi></math>.</p><p>&nbsp;(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;for dielectric medium)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, refractive index is related to velocity as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Since, effective length of antenna&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>l</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>GHz</mi></math>.</p>"
  }
}